sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Пользователь
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant DB_O as Orders DB
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka
    participant PS as Payments Service
    participant DB_P as Payments DB

    User->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders
    GW->>OS: Forward + X-User-Id
    activate OS
    OS->>DB_O: INSERT order<br/>status = PENDING_PAYMENT
    OS->>Kafka: OrderPaymentRequestedEvent
    OS-->>GW: 201 Created + orderId
    deactivate OS
    GW-->>User: 201 Created

    Note over Kafka, PS: Асинхронная обработка (ошибка)

    Kafka->>PS: payment-requests
    activate PS
    PS->>DB_P: Проверка баланса
    Note right of PS: Баланс < суммы заказа
    PS->>Kafka: OrderPaymentFailedEvent<br/>(INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE)
    deactivate PS

    Kafka->>OS: payment-failed
    activate OS
    OS->>DB_O: UPDATE status = FAILED
    deactivate OS